{66}{The Bessie Toone is an old silver mine, just north and a little west of town.  There hasn't been silver down there for a long time, but they'll still bring up some iron ore every once in a while.  Worthless, though, as long as Bessie is a wanderin' her mine.}{The Bessie Toone is an old silver mine, just north and a little west of town.  There hasn't been silver down there for a long time, but they'll still bring up some iron ore every once in a while.  Worthless, though, as long as Bessie is a wanderin' her mine.}{}{}{}{}
